{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>蘋果晶片供應商台積電（TSMC）宣佈，其董事會已批准向人工智能公司 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 投資最多十億美元。根據該決定，台積電可分別購買這兩家公司價值最高五億美元的股份。此外，董事會還授權撥出最高五億美元，用於成立一家將投資於半導體業務及更廣泛行業的公司。</p><h2>鞏固與競爭對手關係</h2><p>台積電負責製造蘋果的客製化晶片，而 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 則正在開發自家的處理器。這些投資加深了台積電與那些在最先進製造產能上與蘋果競爭、以及在人工智能領域展開較量之公司的聯繫。據傳聞，OpenAI 正致力於開發旨在直接與蘋果競爭的硬件產品。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"與 台積電 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d88d1c22c31581393c60ea4425da84e38c0dd5a3f1fe4d9dd4bd91f588c5b82b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F110f0480f65e02bca10955f01cad1910.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:17:48.563244+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":1,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:54:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T21:58:39.416836+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:11:22.964850+00:00","content_hash":"963d6e3ddecfc3fdb973ba4b5e13a3aceaefc0720afc6282dea9d42bdb5e09d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}